WEBVTT

00:00:02.650 --> 00:00:05.500
Everyone, when you're watching Deltora Quest,

00:00:05.500 --> 00:00:09.400
make sure you're in a well-lit
room and sit far away from the TV!

00:00:17.780 --> 00:00:24.000
You are my sun now

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:28.420
We all go through bad times

00:00:28.420 --> 00:00:31.420
no matter who you are

00:00:31.880 --> 00:00:36.840
So don't go hanging your head and feeling down

00:00:38.890 --> 00:00:45.560
Keep your head up until your heart's sky

00:00:45.560 --> 00:00:50.980
is clear again

00:00:51.860 --> 00:00:56.320
No matter where you are in this world

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:59.830
if you're crying and trembling all alone

00:00:59.830 --> 00:01:05.160
I'll search for you, I promise

00:01:05.370 --> 00:01:08.830
Love will show me the way

00:01:10.210 --> 00:01:16.680
The sun dreams countless times

00:01:17.300 --> 00:01:23.520
Forever and always from the horizon

00:01:24.140 --> 00:01:30.860
Its shining light gives energy

00:01:31.900 --> 00:01:38.200
After all, you are my sun now

00:01:58.400 --> 00:02:02.300
<i>Believing that their goal was just within
reach after their long journey,</i>

00:02:02.300 --> 00:02:06.950
<i>Lief and his friends instead witnessed
the kidnapping of Dain by Ichabod,</i>

00:02:06.950 --> 00:02:09.900
<i>with the challenge of rescuing
him standing before them.</i>

00:02:30.100 --> 00:02:32.650
<i>Please hurry; just a little faster.</i>

00:02:32.650 --> 00:02:34.300
Dain's life is at stake...!

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:38.500
Everyone, things are getting
worse with every moment.

00:02:38.500 --> 00:02:42.400
I have no doubt that the Shadow Lord
intends to use Dain for something.

00:02:42.400 --> 00:02:45.460
Use him? What can he do with Dain?

00:02:45.800 --> 00:02:49.600
"King Endon's heir might exist
somewhere out there."

00:02:50.000 --> 00:02:53.450
That thought is the last remaining
hope for the people of Deltora.

00:02:53.450 --> 00:02:55.000
That's exactly right.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:03:01.000
We began this journey to collect all seven
gems because we believed that ourselves.

00:03:01.000 --> 00:03:03.700
And an heir does exist.

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.600
Dain <i>was</i> that heir.

00:03:05.600 --> 00:03:07.900
And yet, just as we figured that out...

00:03:07.900 --> 00:03:14.800
It's for that very reason that the Shadow Lord
needs to put him on display to the people of Deltora.

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:19.900
So basically, he is going to have Dain
executed in public for all to witness.

00:03:19.900 --> 00:03:21.100
No way!

00:03:22.250 --> 00:03:26.500
That's how he's looking to completely
crush the hopes of the people.

00:03:26.500 --> 00:03:29.700
Indeed, this method is very
much like the Shadow Lord.

00:03:29.700 --> 00:03:33.600
We have very little time left to work with.

00:03:40.100 --> 00:03:42.810
Thank you, Ailsa! Be careful!

00:03:43.200 --> 00:03:44.750
Send my regards to Prin!

00:03:44.750 --> 00:03:46.100
Stay well!

00:03:46.100 --> 00:03:48.400
I wish you all the best of luck!

00:03:48.400 --> 00:03:50.000
Farewell!

00:03:50.000 --> 00:03:51.820
Good bye!

00:03:55.000 --> 00:03:57.530
Now, it's time for us to get going as well.

00:03:58.300 --> 00:04:00.600
I will explain the plan from here on out.

00:04:00.600 --> 00:04:04.500
Lief, Barda, and Jasmine, the three who
have been identified by the enemy,

00:04:04.500 --> 00:04:07.800
will head to Del Palace hidden
inside Steven's wagon.

00:04:12.400 --> 00:04:17.200
The rest will split up into the following three
groups so as to avoid the worst case scenario:

00:04:17.200 --> 00:04:18.430
Manus and Nanion,

00:04:21.250 --> 00:04:22.900
Gla-Thon and Fardeep

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:26.700
and finally, Glock and Zeean,
who will remain with me.

00:04:26.700 --> 00:04:27.200
Right.

00:04:27.600 --> 00:04:31.600
We will all sneak into Del Palace in
separate groups and meet up there.

00:04:31.600 --> 00:04:33.900
You say 'sneak in', but...

00:04:33.900 --> 00:04:36.700
Just make your way in under cover of darkness.

00:04:36.700 --> 00:04:39.950
You'll be fine; everyone in
the Resistance does this.

00:04:39.950 --> 00:04:43.000
Once you've snuck in,
you can leave the rest to me.

00:04:43.000 --> 00:04:45.100
Leave it to you? What do you mean?

00:04:45.100 --> 00:04:46.000
Well,

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:47.930
I got my hands on this.

00:04:50.300 --> 00:04:52.500
Isn't that a map of Del Palace?

00:04:52.500 --> 00:04:54.500
How did you get something like this?

00:04:54.500 --> 00:04:58.200
The Ralads were the ones who
actually built Del Palace.

00:04:58.200 --> 00:05:02.000
That's why we also know all
of its secret passageways.

00:05:02.000 --> 00:05:07.200
Once we've saved Dain, we will start the oath
ceremony over again right then and there.

00:05:07.200 --> 00:05:11.200
Then, we will fight the
Shadow Lord with our new king.

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:16.700
But, will this plan be leaked to our enemies?

00:05:16.700 --> 00:05:20.200
Yeah, we still haven't solved
the issue with that spy.

00:05:20.800 --> 00:05:22.500
As far as that's concerned,

00:05:22.500 --> 00:05:24.880
Dain left an important memo behind.

00:05:32.300 --> 00:05:34.380
What did I do wrong?!

00:05:34.380 --> 00:05:36.940
Why do I have to be thrown in here?!

00:05:37.700 --> 00:05:42.500
It seems that Dain witnessed you
corresponding with the Shadow Lord.

00:05:42.500 --> 00:05:44.180
Nonsense! That's a lie!

00:05:45.200 --> 00:05:48.890
Hey, wait! There must be some mistake! Hey!

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:55.360
Go!

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.870
Lief, we will catch up with you soon!

00:05:59.500 --> 00:06:01.800
Let's save Dain!

00:06:01.800 --> 00:06:04.500
If luck's on your side, then meet us in Del Palace!

00:06:05.000 --> 00:06:06.500
You guys be careful as well!

00:06:06.500 --> 00:06:07.900
We'll see you ahead.

00:06:10.600 --> 00:06:12.700
Alright, let's also get moving.

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:13.930
Right!

00:06:12.700 --> 00:06:13.930
Okay!

00:06:16.700 --> 00:06:20.300
<i>All of us are on the move towards our last hope.</i>

00:06:20.300 --> 00:06:23.350
<i>So, we should definitely be able to save Dain.</i>

00:06:23.700 --> 00:06:30.500
I must say, I really didn't think Dain was
the heir until you mentioned it, Lief.

00:06:30.500 --> 00:06:31.400
Yeah.

00:06:31.900 --> 00:06:36.600
It was right around the time when Dain was talking about wanting to go to Tora

00:06:36.600 --> 00:06:39.400
that I first thought it might be possible.

00:06:47.300 --> 00:06:49.250
There's something I want to give you.

00:06:49.900 --> 00:06:50.750
Huh?

00:06:51.300 --> 00:06:54.000
I got this pendant as a gift for you.

00:06:55.900 --> 00:06:58.300
That looks so lovely! Thank you!

00:06:58.300 --> 00:06:59.800
Let me put it on for you.

00:07:04.900 --> 00:07:06.700
It looks good on you, Jasmine.

00:07:07.200 --> 00:07:08.500
Thank you.

00:07:17.500 --> 00:07:19.000
<i>But looking back on it now,</i>

00:07:19.800 --> 00:07:24.790
<i>you seemed like a timid boy when we first met.</i>

00:07:26.600 --> 00:07:30.100
It should be obvious which one of
us is the strongest just by looking!

00:07:30.100 --> 00:07:32.000
I-I'm sorry.

00:07:32.900 --> 00:07:36.600
"The seven gems, each with their own power.

00:07:37.200 --> 00:07:40.950
When they truly come together as one,

00:07:40.950 --> 00:07:43.680
they will unleash an even greater power."

00:07:44.400 --> 00:07:46.800
That's a passage from 'The Belt of Deltora'!

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:49.800
I can't say this for sure,

00:07:49.800 --> 00:07:57.240
but the phrase 'truly come together as one' seems to be the relevant point here.

00:07:57.900 --> 00:08:04.410
Dain, I will save you and revive
the Kingdom of Deltora.

00:08:05.300 --> 00:08:08.900
For the sake of all who love this land!

00:08:25.000 --> 00:08:26.640
Faster, faster!

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:45.000
What's wrong, Steven?

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:46.000
Shh!

00:08:46.000 --> 00:08:49.800
Please stay quiet. I will deal with this somehow.

00:08:50.300 --> 00:08:54.100
I will let you on the wagon,
so will you please let me pass?

00:08:54.100 --> 00:08:56.300
Show yourself, Lief!

00:08:57.400 --> 00:08:58.900
Who is that?!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:05.800
There's nobody else here on this wagon.

00:09:05.800 --> 00:09:08.050
I'm in quite a hurry, so excuse me.

00:09:08.500 --> 00:09:10.800
Then I will force you out.

00:09:21.500 --> 00:09:23.100
What's happening out there?

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:25.000
There's no other choice. Let's fight!

00:09:30.300 --> 00:09:32.990
It's been a while, Lief.

00:09:33.600 --> 00:09:34.800
You're Orcus!

00:09:34.800 --> 00:09:37.900
Weren't you supposed to have
died in the Valley of the Lost?!

00:09:37.900 --> 00:09:42.500
I will pay you back in kind for the
wound you gave me on that day.

00:09:44.700 --> 00:09:45.460
Go!

00:09:56.100 --> 00:09:57.700
Ouch, it's hot!

00:10:04.900 --> 00:10:07.400
It's no use. They're not backing down!

00:10:11.500 --> 00:10:15.700
Barda, these monsters are just
tools under Orcus' control.

00:10:16.600 --> 00:10:20.300
That means we've had our sights
set on the wrong target...

00:10:20.300 --> 00:10:22.300
In that case...

00:10:23.900 --> 00:10:24.500
Let's go!

00:10:24.500 --> 00:10:25.420
Right!

00:10:30.700 --> 00:10:32.300
It's futile.

00:10:41.600 --> 00:10:43.100
I have to do something!

00:10:43.800 --> 00:10:44.800
What?

00:10:50.000 --> 00:10:51.100
That's it!

00:10:51.100 --> 00:10:53.120
Lief, stand back!

00:11:01.900 --> 00:11:03.100
It worked!

00:11:03.100 --> 00:11:04.100
Jasmine!

00:11:04.100 --> 00:11:05.900
It's apple cider!

00:11:05.900 --> 00:11:08.920
What pointless defiance. Burn in agony!

00:11:17.100 --> 00:11:20.900
We can't even get close to Orcus like this!

00:11:20.900 --> 00:11:23.800
At this rate... we'll just burn to death!

00:11:23.800 --> 00:11:25.800
Stay back! Go away!

00:11:27.500 --> 00:11:28.600
Steven!

00:11:28.900 --> 00:11:31.110
Move back! You'll get burned!

00:11:31.900 --> 00:11:33.000
Shit...!

00:11:33.000 --> 00:11:35.000
There's just no end to this!

00:11:35.000 --> 00:11:36.740
What do we do...?

00:12:07.800 --> 00:12:11.400
I'm sorry for slowing you down like this.

00:12:14.000 --> 00:12:16.800
Can't be helped, then. I'll carry you.

00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:18.900
But that would only...

00:12:18.900 --> 00:12:20.700
It doesn't bother me.

00:12:20.700 --> 00:12:24.000
Doom expected this and grouped us together.

00:12:24.000 --> 00:12:26.000
There's nothing to worry about.

00:12:27.200 --> 00:12:28.800
Here, get on.

00:12:29.200 --> 00:12:31.140
Well then, do excuse me.

00:12:32.900 --> 00:12:36.800
I wonder where Lief and the
others are at this moment.

00:12:36.800 --> 00:12:38.200
Let me see...

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:41.600
By now, they must be quite close to Del Palace.

00:12:42.200 --> 00:12:48.700
Those three have endured a difficult
journey to retrieve the gems.

00:12:48.700 --> 00:12:50.800
As long as they survive, we will be fine.

00:12:50.800 --> 00:12:52.800
Well it'd be a problem if they didn't.

00:13:03.600 --> 00:13:04.250
It's hopeless!

00:13:04.500 --> 00:13:06.250
It's hopeless!!

00:13:06.800 --> 00:13:08.300
Calm down, Steven!

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:11.510
Humans really are unsightly.

00:13:12.600 --> 00:13:15.520
Nevets! Help me!

00:13:14.400 --> 00:13:15.520
Steven, stop!

00:13:16.100 --> 00:13:17.200
Wait!

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:19.600
Nevets might be able to do something!

00:13:19.600 --> 00:13:20.800
But...!

00:13:22.900 --> 00:13:24.750
Nevets!!

00:13:24.750 --> 00:13:26.400
Are you okay, Steven?

00:13:26.800 --> 00:13:27.900
Ouch...!

00:13:38.600 --> 00:13:39.410
Nevets!

00:13:48.700 --> 00:13:50.630
Who is that?!

00:13:58.300 --> 00:13:59.300
Let's go!

00:14:38.500 --> 00:14:39.220
What?!

00:15:38.500 --> 00:15:40.600
Are you okay, Steven?

00:15:41.900 --> 00:15:44.200
That's enough, Nevets.

00:15:44.200 --> 00:15:46.600
You can't keep going like this...

00:15:48.900 --> 00:15:50.800
Nevets!!

00:16:13.500 --> 00:16:15.850
Nevets is back...!

00:16:15.850 --> 00:16:16.810
Yeah...

00:16:19.400 --> 00:16:20.700
Nevets...

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:22.700
How is he?

00:16:22.700 --> 00:16:25.900
He's been burned quite badly.

00:16:25.900 --> 00:16:27.400
That's terrible!

00:16:27.400 --> 00:16:30.000
But how are we supposed to treat him?

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:35.100
It's fine. He will heal quickly as
long as he stays inside my body.

00:16:35.100 --> 00:16:36.980
But there is one problem.

00:16:38.300 --> 00:16:41.300
Nevets wasn't able to defeat Orcus.

00:16:56.100 --> 00:16:58.000
This is bad! He's caught up to us!

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:05.900
You will not escape me.

00:17:08.900 --> 00:17:12.000
At this rate, we'll burn down in
flames along with this wagon.

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:13.100
We have to run!

00:17:34.700 --> 00:17:37.200
It seems you've reached the end of the line.

00:17:37.200 --> 00:17:39.600
We have nowhere to run from here!

00:17:39.600 --> 00:17:41.300
Is there nothing we can do...?!

00:17:41.300 --> 00:17:44.300
If we can't fall back, then our
only choice is to push forward.

00:17:44.500 --> 00:17:46.200
I guess that goes without saying.

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:48.120
Let's go!

00:17:51.100 --> 00:17:52.800
Your resistance is futile!

00:18:01.200 --> 00:18:02.500
Not quite!

00:18:02.500 --> 00:18:04.000
How's... this?!

00:18:04.700 --> 00:18:06.000
How boorish!

00:18:11.900 --> 00:18:13.000
Barda!

00:18:14.000 --> 00:18:16.640
I will give you one last chance.

00:18:18.800 --> 00:18:22.200
Swear fealty to the Shadow Lord.

00:18:22.200 --> 00:18:25.200
If you do, not only will you be allowed to live,

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:28.870
but a great many other
pleasures will await you also.

00:18:30.600 --> 00:18:31.610
I refuse!

00:18:31.900 --> 00:18:33.800
What a good for nothing bunch.

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:35.200
Very well!

00:18:38.500 --> 00:18:40.100
You may die, then!

00:18:52.850 --> 00:18:54.900
These three; take their lives!

00:18:57.100 --> 00:18:58.950
Orcus' magic isn't working!

00:18:58.950 --> 00:18:59.900
Now's our chance!

00:19:05.540 --> 00:19:07.660
Why?! Why is my magic not working?!

00:19:08.700 --> 00:19:10.500
Barda, are you alright?

00:19:10.500 --> 00:19:13.600
I'm fine; it's just a small burn.

00:19:13.600 --> 00:19:16.160
Jasmine! That brooch...

00:19:16.800 --> 00:19:17.910
Yeah.

00:19:19.500 --> 00:19:23.100
We have infused that brooch with
magic that will protect you.

00:19:23.100 --> 00:19:26.960
We dearly hope it will be of good use.

00:19:27.500 --> 00:19:32.000
Orcus' magic must have been
sealed thanks to this brooch.

00:19:37.500 --> 00:19:40.700
How? How could I be bested...

00:19:41.500 --> 00:19:42.700
by a mere human?!

00:19:45.100 --> 00:19:46.400
Damn it all!

00:19:53.000 --> 00:19:53.990
Lief...

00:20:02.800 --> 00:20:03.580
Lief!!

00:20:22.300 --> 00:20:24.600
It can't be... Lief...

00:20:24.600 --> 00:20:27.800
To lose to a human such as yourself...

00:20:27.800 --> 00:20:33.200
I can't afford to go down until the
Kingdom of Deltora is restored.

00:20:34.100 --> 00:20:36.400
You fools are playing with fire.

00:20:36.400 --> 00:20:42.400
Somehow, somewhere, you <i>will</i> be
defeated by the Shadow Lord.

00:20:42.400 --> 00:20:48.330
The Shadow Lord is the most supreme being of all.

00:20:48.700 --> 00:20:51.100
No matter how much power he has,

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:55.350
if he uses it for evil, he will eventually
meet his demise as a result!

00:20:57.200 --> 00:20:59.800
Spare me your pretty words.

00:20:59.800 --> 00:21:04.400
I saw it myself... I've seen it since I was a child.

00:21:04.400 --> 00:21:05.700
From when you were a child?

00:21:05.700 --> 00:21:08.300
So you're human?

00:21:08.300 --> 00:21:12.400
The adults would always bow down to power.

00:21:12.400 --> 00:21:16.300
You too will end up like that.

00:21:16.300 --> 00:21:24.000
As long as you're human, you will always
lose against the Shadow Lord...

00:21:24.700 --> 00:21:26.800
You will always lose...

00:21:36.600 --> 00:21:39.100
Orcus. You're mistaken.

00:21:39.100 --> 00:21:42.360
It is <i>because</i> we're human that
we will defeat the Shadow Lord!

00:21:43.700 --> 00:21:45.900
Come on, let's get going.

00:22:07.700 --> 00:22:09.100
We're home.

00:22:09.100 --> 00:22:11.600
Yeah, at long last.

00:22:11.600 --> 00:22:13.700
That's Del Palace...?

00:22:15.050 --> 00:22:15.900
Let's go!

00:22:16.700 --> 00:22:17.600
Yeah.

00:22:18.200 --> 00:22:19.130
Right.

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:53.300
I would be lying to you

00:22:53.470 --> 00:22:59.100
if I said I wasn't lonely

00:22:59.850 --> 00:23:05.610
I know I'm not being honest

00:23:06.190 --> 00:23:11.450
but I just can't put it into words

00:23:12.320 --> 00:23:18.410
It's for the sake of our dreams

00:23:20.080 --> 00:23:22.000
At this point

00:23:22.080 --> 00:23:27.670
to sing "I love you" to a faraway you

00:23:28.000 --> 00:23:33.970
my voice would simply fade into the wind

00:23:34.180 --> 00:23:40.270
In a way, that's worse than saying "goodbye"

00:23:40.390 --> 00:23:47.400
But someday our dreams will bloom

00:23:47.730 --> 00:23:55.740
Dreams X Dreams

00:24:06.100 --> 00:24:08.500
The Seven Gems: the Lapis Lazuli.

00:24:09.100 --> 00:24:12.870
<i>The fourth gem, obtained in the Shifting Sands.</i>

00:24:12.870 --> 00:24:14.500
<i>It can unleash mystical power.</i>

00:24:14.500 --> 00:24:19.800
<i>Able to act as a talisman against evil, it will get
stronger when the stars shine in the night sky.</i>

00:24:21.000 --> 00:24:24.400
The danger that awaited us when
we finally reached Del Palace

00:24:24.400 --> 00:24:26.400
was a large Grey Guard unit.

00:24:26.800 --> 00:24:29.600
Now is the time for us to all work together!

00:24:30.600 --> 00:24:34.000
Next time, 'The Seven Tribes Charge!'

00:24:30.740 --> 00:24:34.740
The Seven Tribes Charge!

00:24:49.750 --> 00:24:54.800
See you next time
